## Pro-Tip: The Ultimate "Juicy" One-Liner Pipeline
If you want to run gau live, filter out all useless asset noise (like images or CSS), clean up duplicate lines, and immediately pull out sensitive parameters all in one shot, use this combined pipeline:

gau --subs target.com | grep -E -v "\.(png|jpg|jpeg|gif|css|woff|svg|pdf|js)" | grep -E "(\?|\=)" | sort -u > juicy_parameters.txt

